        70.86609649658203,
        250.565185546875,
        78.81909942626953,
        263.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.81909942626953,
        250.565185546875,
        526.963134765625,
        263.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "Performance of country-specific cost–effectiveness and cost–benefit analyses of the use of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        266.065185546875,
        291.6165771484375,
        279.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "SL-LPA in different programmatic settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        294.4114074707031,
        472.5246276855469,
        310.7913818359375
      ],
      "text": "2.4.4 High complexity reverse hybridization-based NAATs for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.2114562988281,
        311.6702575683594,
        327.5914306640625
      ],
      "text": "detection of pyrazinamide resistance",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.8424072265625,
        527.0374145507812,
        350.9874267578125
      ],
      "text": "Pyrazinamide is an important antibiotic for the treatment of both drug-susceptible TB and DR-TB",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3424072265625,
        526.9810791015625,
        366.4874267578125
      ],
      "text": "because of its unique ability to eradicate persisting bacilli and its synergistic properties with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        368.8424072265625,
        527.2257080078125,
        381.9874267578125
      ],
      "text": "other antibiotics. Mono-resistance to pyrazinamide is rare; however, pyrazinamide resistance is",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.97426986694336,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.3424072265625,
        526.97021484375,
        397.4874267578125
      ],
      "text": "strongly associated with MDR/RR-TB, with an estimated 30–60% of MDR/RR-TB also resistant",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        399.8424072265625,
        527.0162963867188,
        412.9874267578125
      ],
      "text": "to pyrazinamide. Thus, for people diagnosed with RR-TB, it is important to detect the presence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.991546630859375,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.3424072265625,
        526.991943359375,
        428.4874267578125
      ],
      "text": "of pyrazinamide resistance so that clinicians can make an informed decision on whether to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        430.8424072265625,
        524.2904663085938,
        443.9874267578125
      ],
      "text": "include or exclude pyrazinamide in the treatment regimen. The high complexity hybridization-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.985139846801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        446.3424072265625,
        526.5863647460938,
        459.4874267578125
      ],
      "text": "based NAAT may be used for diagnosis of pyrazinamide resistance on patient isolates; however,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.955811500549316,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        461.8424072265625,
        442.4949035644531,
        474.9874267578125
      ],
      "text": "performance of this test requires appropriate infrastructure and skilled staff.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.3539123535156,
        186.8113250732422,
        503.73388671875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.41429901123047,
        525.9869995117188,
        512.151611328125,
        538.9010009765625
      ],
      "text": "16.\t In people with bacteriologically confirmed TB, high complexity reverse",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41429901123047,
        541.4869995117188,
        512.425048828125,
        554.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "hybridization-based NAATs may be used on  culture isolates for detection  Mtb",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 10.998149871826172,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        108.41429901123047,
        556.9869995117188,
        473.3174743652344,
        569.9010009765625
      ],
      "text": "of pyrazinamide resistance rather than culture-based phenotypic DST.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        105.25679779052734,
        581.02392578125,
        509.5946350097656,
        593.9049072265625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence for diagnostic accuracy)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-LtIt",
      "size": 10.985790252685547,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.8930053710938,
        526.829345703125,
        637.0380249023438
      ],
      "text": "In terms of subgroups to be considered for this recommendation, no special considerations are",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.977276802062988,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.3930053710938,
        526.9591674804688,
        652.5380249023438
      ],
      "text": "required (e.g. for children, people living with HIV and those with extrapulmonary TB), given",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.8930053710938,
        346.059814453125,
        668.0380249023438
      ],
      "text": "that the test is recommended for use on culture isolates.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        680.4046020507812,
        173.49029541015625,
        696.7846069335938
      ],
      "text": "Test description",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Md",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        707.0355834960938,
        524.406494140625,
        720.1806030273438
      ],
      "text": "Nipro (Osaka, Japan) developed Genoscholar™ PZA-TB, an LPA with reverse hybridization-",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        722.5355834960938,
        526.982421875,
        735.6806030273438
      ],
      "text": "based technology for detection of pyrazinamide resistance  . This assay is a commercially  (12)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        738.0355834960938,
        526.9153442382812,
        751.1806030273438
      ],
      "text": "available rapid molecular test for detection of pyrazinamide resistance. Compared with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        753.5355834960938,
        526.9625854492188,
        766.6806030273438
      ],
      "text": "MTBDR  and MTBDR  LPA, the Genoscholar PZA-TB LPA does not include specific mutant  plus sl",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        40.76240158081055,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "92 WHO consolidated",
